## Notes: v0.1.0 - capture POC. A dungeon route IS a sequence of pulls, so record the pulls: combat start and end are the markers, the path between them is sampled once a second out of combat, and both entrances are captured automatically. Records everything and filters nothing - judgement happens offline against the whole set. No beacon work, no editor, no display. /dr
